port              Generate comprehensive architectural markdown report\n    cluster             Detect and inspect architectural communities/clusters\n    viz                 Generate standalone interactive HTML graph visualizer\n    export              Export knowledge graph to GraphRAG JSON, Obsidian,\n                        GraphML, or SCIP\n    bundle              Extract 5 high-density fact bundle markdown files for\n                        LLM architecture reports\n    setup               Configure AI coding harnesses (OMP / Pi, OpenCode,\n                        Antigravity, Claude, ZCode)\n    pack                Package a k-hop ContextBundle (YAML) for AI agent\n                        prompt registers\n    watch               Watch filesystem and reconcile in real time (daemon &\n                        multi-project support)\n    trace               Extract Full-Stack execution path, UI decisions, API\n                        binding, and Mermaid diagrams\n    import-scip         Import compiler-backed SCIP index into Multi-Provider\n                        Evidence Storage\n    ui-tree             Extract local Frontend UI decision tree, validation\n                        rules, and modals\n    be-flow             Extract Backend processing steps, multi-datasources,\n                        and exception branches\n    solution            Automated Solution Architecture and Manpower\n                        Estimation Engine\n    scope-receipt       PRE-change bounded evidence receipt for one edit\n                        target\n    receipt             Human-readable view of serialized assurance receipts\n                        (read-only, SG-205)\n    providers           Detect, list, and diagnose evidence providers (read-\n                        only)\n    diff-impact         Git diff blast radius, upstream caller traversal, and\n                        API impact analysis\n    claims              Lint public trust claims in docs against the claim\